"Pi Pa carries a hungry entity called the Void, sealed and restrained in her chest."
"Pi Pa's bite, through the Void, can devour matter."
"Enraged, Pi Pa can become a huge many-mouthed shadow horror, a Beast of the Void."
"Pi Pa's Void nearly devoured part of the forest, and almost Chun Ke, during the demon attack."
"Pi Pa's void-bite could not touch Jin at all; it was like fitting a mountain in her mouth."
